# Spectral Bear Cub: the 25-point reward of the Legacy Progress Track.
# The cub is the 25 Legacy Points reward.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 (item
# 277714).

step 25 Legacy Points
  tip Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, professions, PvP, exploring) is worth one. The Progress Track gives the Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, the Spectral Bear Cub at 25, the Spectral Bear Tabard at 40 and the Reins of the Spectral Bear at 55. How rewards are delivered is not known yet (perhaps by mail); this goal ticks once the cub is in your bags.
  collect 277714 "Spectral Bear Cub"
